        {
          "text": "Ngaaya makani aakasika kuli-Jeremiya kuzwa kuli-Jehova, mwami Zedekiya naakamana kutangana cizuminano abantu boonse bamu-Jerusalemu akubalailila makani aabulubusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
